Migrate S3 uploads from the deprecated feature/s3/manager to feature/s3/transfermanager. The transfer manager continues to inherit the client's RequestChecksumCalculation, so multipart uploads to S3-compatible backends keep working (#10543). Multipart upload now starts above 16 MiB (previously 5 MiB) with 8 MiB parts (previously 5 MiB): objects between 5 and 16 MiB upload as a single PutObject instead of a two-part multipart, and the per-upload part buffer pool grows from about 30 MB to about 48 MB.
